    "distinction_note": "Primary subject nvidia-ai-agents-ai-factory-operations covers GPU-cluster AIOps on DGX H100/B200/GB300 SuperPODs (NemoClaw, OpenClaw gateway, MCP tools, OpenShell credential-less sandboxes, server-side read-only run_kubectl RBAC, six cluster sub-agents, zero published MTTR/RCA benchmarks, injected-fault demo Video 1). Same-day companion FOX Blueprint (Samuel Ochoa & Carlos Garcia-Sierra, unpublished draft in repo) shares NemoClaw + OpenShell + Nemotron + HITL patterns but targets physical PCB/SMT manufacturing lines (Cosmos, Isaac Sim/ROS 2, Kumo Anomaly, Elasticsearch) and cites Siemens production-planning/virtual-AOI figures (up to 20% cost savings, up to 40% TTM reduction) that must never be conflated with GPU cluster AIOps."
